      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also like to add filtering out featured/pubic events from showing up on the site. I was just on there and had an event from Stoners United in my face and I personally do not care to have that stuff in my feed at all. I'm not in many groups and only maybe two or three of them do I actually care to know if they are doing an event as most I joined because of friends so I can be part of some instances they are in so if you are going to put this stuff in my face please let me choose what I want to see there and what I don't want just like I can with personally offensive avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
