      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I get that some people may like it. I cannot attest to how much I do not wanna boot up the \"Live Now\" menu and immediately be hit with \"Paw Lovers Meet\" from \"Please Step On Me.\" \n\nThis desperately needs the ability to filter out groups I am not apart of.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-10-17T21:49:33.180Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Personally, I do not want the \"Live Now\" tab to have a giant 'featured' event at the top whenever I open the menu. Especially if it is for a group I am not apart of.\n\nPlease add the ability to filter out the \"featured events\" entirely. While it is a great idea and I do like that it is on by default, I personally do not have interest in joining a murder mystery game. I find the giant banner at the top of my screen distracting when I am just trying to take a quick peek at friend and groups. It makes the live now menu feel inferior to the social menu.\n\nIf there is a way to filter these and I am not able to find the menu where it exists, please let me know.",
